# Senior Next.js Todo App Implementation Plan

This plan outlines the creation of a high-end, responsive Todo application using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Framer Motion. The app will feature a premium UI with glassmorphism, smooth animations, and full CRUD operations.

## User Review Required

- **Stack**: Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, Lucide React.
- **Design**: Modern dark-themed glassmorphism with vibrant accents.
- **Persistence**: Local storage will be used for persistence in this simple version.

## Proposed Changes

### Project Initialization

#### [NEW] Initialization
Run `npx -y create-next-app@latest . --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app --src-dir --import-alias "@/*" --use-npm` in the current directory (`d:\TodoPro`).

### Core Application Structure

#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///d:/TodoPro/src/app/globals.css)
Update with a premium design system, including custom fonts (Inter/Outfit), fluid gradients, and utility classes for glassmorphism.

#### [NEW] [types/todo.ts](file:///d:/TodoPro/src/types/todo.ts)
Define the `Todo` interface.
```typescript
export interface Todo {
  id: string;
  text: string;
  completed: boolean;
  createdAt: number;
}
```

### Components

#### [NEW] [components/TodoContainer.tsx](file:///d:/TodoPro/src/components/TodoContainer.tsx)
Main state management using hooks (`useState`, `useEffect`). Handles CRUD logic and filters.

#### [NEW] [components/TodoHeader.tsx](file:///d:/TodoPro/src/components/TodoHeader.tsx)
Dynamic header with progress bar and statistics.

#### [NEW] [components/TodoInput.tsx](file:///d:/TodoPro/src/components/TodoInput.tsx)
Premium input field with validation, focus states, and keyboard support.

#### [NEW] [components/TodoItem.tsx](file:///d:/TodoPro/src/components/TodoItem.tsx)
Animated list item (Framer Motion) with edit, delete, and complete functionality.

#### [NEW] [components/EmptyState.tsx](file:///d:/TodoPro/src/components/EmptyState.tsx)
Elegant placeholder for empty lists.

### Pages

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///d:/TodoPro/src/app/page.tsx)
Main landing page implementing the Todo layout.

## Open Questions

- Should we include a filter for "Active", "Completed", and "All"? (Proposed: Yes, for a senior-level app).
- Should we use a specific color theme (e.g., Purple/Blue or Emerald/Green)? (Proposed: Modern Indigo/Violet).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Manual verification of CRUD functionality.
- Performance check on animation smoothness.
- Responsive design verification across mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports.

### Manual Verification
- Testing add, edit, toggle, and delete.
- Verifying local storage persistence upon page reload.
- Checking focus management for accessibility.
